                                                "sense_id": "c3c4dec3-9105-34d9-9d7f-5724813ff195",
                                                "text": "Still there was a cheerful appearance; a capital fire burnt in the bright grate; there were some stands of thriving plants in the windows; and some canaries and Java sparrows chirped as if they were quite content to be \"hereditary bondsmen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
